{
  "speakers": {
    "npc": {
      "name": {
        "type": "expression",
        "expression": "q.npc.name"
      },
      "face": "q.npc.face();"
    }
  },
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "line_0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [],
      "input": {
        "type": "auto-continue",
        "delay": 0.01,
        "allowSkip": false,
        "action": [
          "v.reward_type='item';",
          "v.reward='cobblemon:pokedex_red';",
          "t.reward_landing = q.run_script('ccs:reward__landing');",
          "t.next_page = t.reward_landing == 'reward_give' ? 'line_1' : t.reward_landing;",
          "q.dialogue.set_page(t.next_page)"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reward_give",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Here, take these with you."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.run_script('ccs:give_reward');",
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_6');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reward_gave",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Get moving! Truly, this is a great undertaking in Pok\u00e9mon history!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.close();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bye",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [],
      "input": {
        "type": "auto-continue",
        "delay": 0.01,
        "allowSkip": false,
        "action": [
          "q.dialogue.close();"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Hello there! My name is Oak. People call me the Pok\u00e9mon Professor!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_2');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Recently, there have been sightings of many rare Pok\u00e9mon species."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_3');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "I'm talking about Pok\u00e9mon that have never been seen in Kanto."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_4');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_4",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "I would love to check it out myself, but I'm much too old."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_5');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_5",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Since I can't do it, I'd like you to go in my place."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('reward_give');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_6",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "It is my invention, the Pok\u00e9dex!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_7');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_7",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "It is a high-tech encyclopedia that automatically records data on Pok\u00e9mon you have seen or caught."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_8');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_8",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "To make a complete guide on all the Pok\u00e9mon in the world..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_9');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_9",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "That was my dream!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('reward_gave');"
      ]
    }
  ]
}